<title>UK: UBS SETS WARRANTS ON SBC SHARES.</title>
<headline>UBS SETS WARRANTS ON SBC SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Zurich said it has issued 50 million American-style call warrants, on Swiss Bank Corp registered shares.</p>
<p> One share is controlled by 20 warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    450 CHF		   PREMIUM	19.7 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     2.52 CHF		  GEARING	8.3 X</p>
<p> EXPIRY	    15.JAN.99		 PAYDATE	22.AUG.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS EXCHANGE	  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  418 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
